{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "05167ee2-caae-8d38-8381-c328f1a2908a",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T15:41:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Samir Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:37:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:37:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good afternoon. I'm calling about water sitting at the curb by my place. It's a hundred twenty-six Memorial Boulevard, the Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:37:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 126 Memorial. What's it doing, is it backing up from a drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:37:56-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not backing up exactly. It's just ponding. There's no storm, it's been dry all week. It's the meltwater from the snow pile, it runs down and sits right at the curb in front of the drain. Then overnight it freezes. Every morning there's a sheet of black ice there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:38:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Right on the sidewalk side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:38:25-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right where people step out of their cars. I have a shop here, customers park there. Somebody is going to go down hard. I already put salt out twice, it doesn't matter, the water just keeps coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:38:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Do you think the drain is clogged, or is it just not taking the water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:38:52-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't know. Could be clogged with sand and leaves. And there's something else. There's a manhole cover near it that looks off. Maybe an inch higher on one side, like it's not sitting flat. Cars hit it and it makes a clunk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll put that in too. A cover that's not seated right is something they'll want to look at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:39:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Hold on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:39:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ma, ami ta ligadu ku Prefeitura, un minutu. Sim, sim, dja fala ku el."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:39:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry about that. My mother is here in the shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:39:40-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. So I've got 126 Memorial Boulevard, ponding at the curb that's freezing overnight, possible clogged drain, and a manhole cover sitting about an inch off. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:39:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's it. Honestly I'm kind of annoyed, because I figured the plows or somebody would've noticed. It's a main road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:40:07-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. It is a busy stretch. I'll send this over to the crew that handles drains and they'll go out and check it. With the ice, I'll flag it as a slip hazard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:40:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Do you know when? Like today, tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:40:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say within a day or two, depending on what else is on their list. Since it's freezing at night, I'll note that it's more urgent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:40:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Fine. Can somebody call me back when it's done? So I know it's actually done and I'm not out there checking every morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:40:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll put that on the request. What's the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:41:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:41:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0195. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:41:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Samir Abdi. A-B-D-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:41:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Abdi. Anything else going on out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:41:16-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. I've been stuck in here all day with this on my mind. After I close up I'm going to drive out along Ocean Drive for a while, clear my head."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:41:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a nice drive this time of year, clear and cold. In the meantime, keep the salt going if you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:41:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I will. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T15:41:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
